{"lyrics":"[00:00.70]I'm stompin'\n[00:04.66]Let's start a moshpit\n[00:09.88]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit\n[00:12.48]Yeah\n[00:12.92]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here (Ya dig)\n[00:15.84]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating codfish in here (Uh-huh)\n[00:19.12]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[00:20.84]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Fuck a protest)\n[00:22.74]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here (Ya dig)\n[00:25.34]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating cod fish in here (Eating cod fish in here)\n[00:27.44]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Skrrt)\n[00:29.00]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Start a moshpit)\n[00:37.26]Out of space, hot like a martian in here\n[00:39.86]Doing donuts in the lot, ain't no parking in here (Yeah)\n[00:43.42]We about that action, ain't no talking in here\n[00:45.90]Shorty twerking on the walls, Peter Parker in here (Ayy)\n[00:49.34]Haters in the rear view\n[00:50.92]Ex on my phone, we too loud, I can't hear you\n[00:53.70]His blood turn his coat red, I will Paul Revere you\n[00:57.02]I'ma ball 'til I fall, I will Cavalier you\n[00:59.90]Space Jam jumping, they asking who let the monsters in here\n[01:03.44]I'm with killers I'm with straight Jeffrey Dahmers in here\n[01:06.40]I hang with animals, lil' brodie brought the llama in here\n[01:09.46]Money old, old enough to fuck your mama in here, oh yeah\n[01:12.34]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here (Ya dig)\n[01:16.68]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating codfish in here (Uh-huh)\n[01:19.88]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[01:21.66]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Fuck a protest)\n[01:23.64]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here (Ya dig)\n[01:26.10]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating cod fish in here\n[01:29.26](Eating cod fish in here)\n[01:31.92]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Skrrt)\n[01:34.90]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit (Start a moshpit)\n[01:37.98]Fuck a protest, let's start a fight in here\n[01:40.76]I just stepped up in the party, all my snipers here\n[01:43.84]I be rocking Tom Ford, popping Molly, though\n[01:46.76]Now I'm eating calamari, no more sloppy joe\n[01:49.76]Choke sandwich in my mansion, tryna save for dinner\n[01:52.94]I'ma start a moshpit in the Staples Center\n[01:55.90]All you niggas bitter, it's alright, though\n[01:58.90]Codeine in my liver, I'm sippin' hydro\n[02:01.72]I'm blowing nitro, smoking jetpack\n[02:05.00]Hating on a street nigga, can't respect that\n[02:07.96]I wanna jump out in a crowd, but I be scared to do it\n[02:10.62]'Cause if they pull on me the wrong way, I'ma go to shooting\n[02:14.02]Yeah, red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here\n[02:17.22]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating codfish in here\n[02:20.48]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here (Yeah)\n[02:23.50]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit\n[02:26.56]Red bottom kicks, I feel like stomping in here\n[02:29.48]No oatmeal and grits, I'm eating cod fish in here (Ayy)\n[02:32.68]New space coupe, feel like a martian in here\n[02:35.64]Fuck a protest, let's start a moshpit","words":[[0.7,1.9,"I'm"],[2.1,3.38,"stompin'"],[4.66,4.78,"Let's"],[4.82,5.14,"start"],[5.18,5.18,"a"],[5.26,5.92,"moshpit"],[9.88,10.04,"Fuck"],[10.08,10.08,"a"],[10.24,10.92,"protest,"],[11.02,11.1,"let's"],[11.14,11.28,"start"],[11.32,11.32,"a"],[11.44,12.24,"moshpit"],[12.48,12.88,"Yeah"],[12.92,13.14,"Red"],[13.24,13.44,"bottom"],[13.62,13.86,"kicks,"],[13.9,13.9,"I"],[13.98,14.08,"feel"],[14.12,14.22,"like"],[14.28,14.96,"stomping"],[15.0,15.14,"in"],[15.18,15.62,"here"],[15.66,15.68,"(Ya"],[15.72,15.8,"dig)"],[15.84,15.96,"No"],[16.0,16.46,"oatmeal"],[16.52,16.56,"and"],[16.66,16.88,"grits,"],[16.92,17.06,"I'm"],[17.14,17.28,"eating"],[17.42,17.98,"codfish"],[18.08,18.2,"in"],[18.24,18.5,"here"],[18.94,19.08,"(Uh-huh)"],[19.12,19.16,"New"],[19.2,19.6,"space"],[19.7,19.9,"coupe,"],[19.94,20.06,"feel"],[20.1,20.26,"like"],[20.3,20.3,"a"],[20.34,20.4